VT_TRANSLATION("NAVIGATION\n\nD-pad means the directional buttons; left/right mean those buttons, not the sticks. Stick controls are named explicitly.\n\n or tap the logo: open Sections. D-pad/left stick selects,  opens,  closes the panel.  opens page options;  and  close the opposite panel. Multi-column menus also accept left/right. Only the vertical  lists in Legacy, VMD, Deck 90 and Aperture scroll with up/down, the left stick, dragging or bottom arrows. The Ghost Mesh, Signal, Relay and Mosaic wheel/grids stay fixed: use directions to select entries in their actual positions. All actions remain visible. The title and controls stay fixed.\n\nSections: Home, Network, Jellyfin, Navidrome, Immich, Radio/Podcast, IPTV, Settings, Controls guide and About. Player and Download appear when available. In browsers with a visible mini-player, Start restores playback and Select is reserved for input lock; use available options for other actions or stop the mini-player first.\n\nIn this guide: up/down selects a chapter; Right or  enters its text. Up/down scrolls text, Left returns to the index. Tap chapters or text and drag to scroll.  exits;  opens Sections.\n\nSettings: left/right changes tabs; Down or  enters rows. Up/down selects,  changes the value. Touch selects or activates the visible control.\n\nHOME AND THEMES\n\nIntegrated Home: the Home tab brings together unfinished media, saved connections, favourites and recent activity. The d-pad or left stick moves between widgets;  opens the selected item.  shows the next item in that widget,  the previous one.  searches all media;  focuses the sections. Explore sources and History open full collections, not alternative Home views. Saved connections open the actual server using the usual authentication and trust prompts.\n\nIn search,  changes provider;  opens media/folders/feeds.  goes back and then returns Home;  returns Home. Cache and progressive results stay usable while sources respond. Up to 24 results per provider; resume is local and radio/channels reopen live.\n\nThe tabs are Home, Video, Music, Radio, Podcast and Images. Radio and online podcasts show favourites; open discovery with  > Radio/Podcast. Newer themes show offline podcasts as an entry to open; Legacy places them beside online favourites.\n\nThe first hints above describe the active theme. Other guide chapters use the same controls unless stated otherwise.\n\nLegacy / VMD: from the first row, press Up to focus tabs. Left/right changes tabs; Down enters results. D-pad/left stick navigates results;  opens.\n\nVMD uses Sony PAF components across the app with Legacy layout and controls. Hold + at startup to recover to Legacy if it cannot start.\n\nGhost Mesh: the right stick selects a section on the wheel. Return it to centre before selecting again after closing a menu. D-pad and left stick always control the list on the left.  opens the selected entry; the two sides remain independent.\n\nDeck 90: up/down selects in the left menu. Right or  enters results; Left returns to the menu. Up/down scrolls results;  opens.\n\nSignal: left/right selects the top tabs; Down or  enters results. Up from the first row returns to tabs. Use grid directions within results.\n\nAperture: tabs are at the bottom. Left/right selects; Up or  enters content. Down from the last entry returns to tabs. Up/down scrolls content;  opens.\n\nRelay: up/down selects in the side menu; Right or  enters the grid. Left from its left edge returns to the menu; elsewhere it moves between cards.\n\nMosaic: left/right selects the top tabs; Down or  enters covers. Left/right selects a cover within the page; Down advances a page, Up returns to the previous page. Up from the first page returns to tabs.\n\nTap visible sections and entries. Change order in Settings > Interface > Theme tab positions: up/down selects an entry, left/right moves it,  saves,  cancels. Each theme keeps its own order.\n\nRADIO AND PODCASTS\n\n > Radio/Podcast opens discovery.  groups search, countries/genres, favourites, URL entry and refresh. In station/show lists,  searches, Start adds a URL and  adds or removes the favourite, including from Home.  names the action explicitly. In the provider, Up from the first row focuses Radio/Podcast tabs; left/right switches provider and Down or  enters content.  retraces previous levels and keeps the selection. In countries,  selects and  searches; Start resets the default catalogue. A short Select press opens details.\n\n on a station starts listening. In the player,  pauses; Play reconnects live without replaying old audio. Titles and artwork depend on the station.\n\nPodcasts resume from saved progress, including after a restart. Saving runs in the background; forcibly closing the app can lose roughly the last 15 seconds. Completed episodes or progress below ten seconds start at the beginning.\n\n on a podcast opens episodes.  on an episode streams it; Start downloads to your chosen folder.  or a short Select press opens description and authors.  returns to the previous list. Scroll to load more pages.\n\nIPTV\n\n > IPTV shows saved playlists and channels. Select Add M3U playlist and press . Enter the playlist HTTP(S) link or choose Scan QR. Add and open asks for a name, validates the playlist, saves it and opens its channels. Extensionless links work; this flow always treats them as playlists. Open without saving is for this session only.\n\nThe d-pad and left stick follow the visible layout. Up moves from channels to their actions and then the top controls; Down returns to the grid. An incomplete last row still has a downward neighbour.  opens a playlist or plays a channel;  toggles its favourite.  searches; Select renames the entry or current playlist.  offers management, refresh and filters.\n\nAfter adding,  returns to saved entries with the new playlist selected. Open without saving returns to the form. Open a direct stream in Options separates a single HLS/DASH or video-file link from channel playlists; its format is automatic and Select changes it when needed.\n\nIn playback,  opens Video quality, Audio language and Programme. Choose a row with Up/Down and  to see the source variants and available languages;  applies the selection. Playback reconnects and restores the previous format if the new one fails. 1080p and bitrates above 4 Mbps are not automatically blocked. Programme shows title, times, description and the next show when the playlist provides XMLTV; Up/Down scrolls and  refreshes.\n\nDuring connection,  or Cancel stops loading. In playback  pauses/resumes and  toggles the favourite. Live resumes at the live point; segmented VOD resumes in place without seeking. Compatible MP4/MKV files use the video-player controls.\n\nNETWORK AND DOWNLOADS\n\nNetwork:  adds a server,  edits, a short Select press removes its saved configuration.  connects or opens.  opens options where available. In remote folders,  refreshes;  opens Jellyfin details or downloads from file servers.\n\nJellyfin:  > Jellyfin, immediately before Navidrome, opens existing saved servers.  connects,  adds,  edits;  also offers Remove connection with confirmation. Videos use the video-player controls; returning restores the folder and selection.\n\nNavidrome and Immich: open their  section or Music/Images entry.  connects,  adds,  edits;  opens Options with Connect, Add, Edit and Remove connection. Removal requires a fresh  confirmation;  cancels and remote content is retained. Navidrome uses the music player, Immich the image viewer.\n\nOpen Network > Direct link/QR or IPTV > Start > Scan QR, then aim at an HTTP/HTTPS link.  or Cancel returns without accepting it. Text entry and confirmation use the system keyboard.\n\nDownload destination:  enters a folder,  creates one, Start chooses the current location.  goes to its parent and cancels at the root. During transfer, Start pauses/resumes;  aborts. Background or  lets it continue;  > Download reopens progress.\n\nPLAYER\n\nThe first line above shows the active video/music mapping. Normally  opens Sections,  Options and left/right seeks. Settings > Controls can swap these groups: directional buttons open panels and / seek. The horizontal left stick remains a seek control. Live radio cannot seek.\n\n pauses/resumes. Vertical right stick changes volume. A short Start press, released before about one second, minimizes where supported; in the mini-player it restores fullscreen. Hold Start for about one second to toggle OLED ECO. Hold Select for about one second to lock/unlock input; a short press does not lock it.\n\nTap video to show/hide controls. Drag the timeline to seek where available.  stops fullscreen playback; use a short Start press to keep listening.\n\nVideo options: up/down selects a row; left/right prepares an audio/subtitle choice,  applies it;  closes the panel. Seeking keeps the subtitle selection on supported files.\n\nMusic options: up/down selects;  or left/right changes shuffle, repeat or colours.  > Player changes artwork layout without restarting audio. Layout follows the theme or your saved choice.\n\nIMAGES\n\n zooms in.  zooms out.  rotates 90 degrees. Start resets zoom, position and rotation. D-pad/left stick pans; release to stop movement.\n\nDrag with one finger to pan; pinch with two to zoom. Tap to show/hide controls.  opens Sections,  image information.  closes an open panel or returns to files.\n\nRotation cycles through 0, 90, 180 and 270 degrees. The right stick and two-finger twist are not rotation controls.", "导航\n\nD-pad 表示方向按钮；左/右指的是按钮，而不是摇杆。摇杆控制有明确的命名。\n\n 或点击徽标：打开部分。方向键/左摇杆选择， 打开， 关闭面板。  打开页面选项； 和关闭对面的面板。多列菜单也接受左/右。 Legacy、VMD、Deck 90 和 Aperture 中只有垂直  列表可通过上/下、左摇杆、拖动或底部箭头滚动。幽灵网格、信号、中继和马赛克轮/网格保持固定：使用方向在实际位置选择条目。所有操作均保持可见。标题和控件保持固定。\n\n部分：主页、网络、Jellyfin、Navidrome、Immich、广播/播客、IPTV、设置、控制指南和关于。播放器和下载可用时出现。在具有可见迷你播放器的浏览器中，“开始”恢复播放，“选择”保留用于输入锁定；使用可用选项进行其他操作或首先停止迷你播放器。\n\n在本指南中： 上/下选择章节；右键或 输入其文本。向上/向下滚动文本，向左返回索引。点击章节或文本并拖动以滚动。  退出；  打开部分。\n\n设置：左/右更改选项卡；向下或  输入行。上/下选择， 改变数值。触摸选择或激活可见控件。\n\n主页和主题\n\n集成主页：“主页”选项卡汇集了未完成的媒体、保存的连接、收藏夹和最近的活动。方向键或左摇杆在小部件之间移动；  打开所选项目。  显示该小部件中的下一项， 显示上一项。  搜索所有媒体；  重点关注部分。探索来源和历史打开完整的收藏，而不是替代的主页视图。保存的连接使用通常的身份验证和信任提示打开实际服务器。\n\n在搜索中， 更改提供商；  打开媒体/文件夹/提要。 返回，然后返回Home；  回家了。当源响应时，缓存和渐进结果保持可用。每个提供商最多 24 个结果；恢复是本地的，广播/频道重新开放直播。\n\n这些选项卡包括“主页”、“视频”、“音乐”、“广播”、“播客”和“图像”。广播和在线播客显示最爱；使用  > 广播/播客进行开放发现。较新的主题将离线播客显示为打开的入口；传统将它们置于网上最爱的旁边。\n\n上面的第一个提示描述了活动主题。除非另有说明，其他指南章节使用相同的控件。\n\n旧版/VMD：从第一行开始，按向上键可聚焦选项卡。左/右更改选项卡；向下输入结果。方向键/左摇杆导航结果；  打开。\n\nVMD 在整个应用程序中使用索尼 PAF 组件以及传统布局和控件。启动时按住+，如果无法启动，可恢复到Legacy。\n\n幽灵网格：右摇杆选择轮盘上的一个部分。关闭菜单后再次选择之前将其返回到中心。方向键和左摇杆始终控制左侧的列表。  打开所选条目；双方保持独立。\n\nDeck 90：在左侧菜单中向上/向下选择。右或输入结果；向左返回菜单。向上/向下滚动结果；  打开。\n\n信号：左/右选择顶部选项卡；向下或 输入结果。从第一行向上返回到选项卡。在结果中使用网格方向。\n\n光圈：选项卡位于底部。左/右选择；向上或输入内容。从最后一个条目向下返回到选项卡。向上/向下滚动内容；  打开。\n\n继电器：侧面菜单中上/下选择；右或进入网格。向左从其左边缘返回到菜单；在其他地方，它会在卡片之间移动。\n\n马赛克：左/右选择顶部标签；向下或进盖。左/右选择页面内的封面；向下前进一页，向上返回上一页。从第一页向上返回到选项卡。\n\n点击可见部分和条目。在“设置”>“界面”>“主题”选项卡位置中更改顺序：上/下选择条目，左/右移动条目， 保存， 取消。每个主题都有自己的顺序。\n\n广播和播客\n\n > 广播/播客打开发现。  分组搜索、国家/流派、收藏夹、URL 输入和刷新。在电台/节目列表中， 搜索，开始添加 URL， 添加或删除收藏夹，包括从主页中删除。  明确命名该操作。在提供程序中，从第一行向上聚焦“广播/播客”选项卡；左/右切换提供商并向下或  输入内容。  回撤之前的水平并保留选择。在国家中， 选择， 搜索；开始重置默认目录。短按选择键可打开详细信息。\n\n电台上的  开始收听。播放器中， 暂停；播放重新连接实时，无需重播旧音频。标题和艺术作品取决于电台。\n\n播客从保存的进度恢复，包括重新启动后。在后台保存运行；强行关闭应用程序可能会损失大约最后 15 秒的时间。已完成的剧集或进度低于十秒从头开始。\n\n 在播客上打开剧集。  在某一集上进行直播；开始下载到您选择的文件夹。  或短按选择键可打开描述和作者。  返回上一个列表。滚动加载更多页面。\n\n网络电视\n\n > IPTV 显示保存的播放列表和频道。选择添加 M3U 播放列表并按 。输入播放列表 HTTP(S) 链接或选择扫描 QR。添加并打开要求输入名称、验证播放列表、保存并打开其频道。无扩展链接有效；此流程始终将它们视为播放列表。打开而不保存仅适用于本次会话。\n\n方向键和左摇杆遵循可见布局。向上从通道移动到其操作，然后是顶部控制；向下返回网格。不完整的最后一行仍然有一个向下的邻居。  打开播放列表或播放频道；  切换其最爱。  搜索；选择重命名条目或当前播放列表。  提供管理、刷新和过滤功能。\n\n添加后， 返回到已保存的条目，并选择新的播放列表。打开而不保存返回到表单。在选项中打开直接流将单个 HLS/DASH 或视频文件链接与频道播放列表分开；它的格式是自动的，并且“选择”会在需要时更改它。\n\n播放时， 打开视频质量、音频语言和节目。选择带有向上/向下和  的行以查看源变体和可用语言；  应用该选择。如果新格式失败，播放会重新连接并恢复之前的格式。 1080p 和高于 4 Mbps 的比特率不会自动阻止。当播放列表提供XMLTV时，节目显示标题、时间、描述和下一个节目；向上/向下滚动和  刷新。\n\n连接期间， 或取消停止加载。在播放过程中， 暂停/恢复， 切换收藏夹。直播点恢复直播；分段点播就地恢复，无需寻找。兼容的 MP4/MKV 文件使用视频播放器控件。\n\n网络和下载\n\n网络： 添加服务器， 编辑，短按选择键删除其保存的配置。  连接或打开。  打开可用选项。在远程文件夹中，刷新；  打开 Jellyfin 详细信息或从文件服务器下载。\n\nJellyfin： > Jellyfin，紧接在 Navidrome 之前，打开现有已保存的服务器。  连接、 添加、 编辑；  还提供删除连接并确认。视频使用视频播放器控件；返回将恢复文件夹和选择。\n\nNavidrome 和 Immich：打开他们的  部分或音乐/图像条目。  连接、 添加、 编辑；  打开带有连接、添加、编辑和删除连接的选项。移除需要新的确认；  取消并保留远程内容。 Navidrome 使用音乐播放器，Immich 使用图像查看器。\n\n打开网络 > 直接链接/QR 或 IPTV > 开始 > 扫描 QR，然后瞄准 HTTP/HTTPS 链接。  或取消不接受就返回。文本输入和确认使用系统键盘。\n\n下载目的地：进入文件夹，创建一个，开始选择当前位置。  转到其父级并在根处取消。传输过程中，开始暂停/恢复；  中止。后台或者让它继续；  > 下载重新打开进度。\n\n玩家\n\n上面的第一行显示活动的视频/音乐映射。通常， 打开部分、 选项和左/右搜索。设置 > 控件可以交换这些组：方向按钮打开面板和 / 搜索。水平左摇杆仍然是搜索控件。直播电台无法搜索。\n\n 暂停/恢复。垂直右摇杆可改变音量。短按“开始”按钮，在大约一秒之前松开，可最大限度地减少受支持的地方；在迷你播放器中它恢复全屏。按住“开始”约一秒钟可切换 OLED ECO。按住 Select 约一秒可锁定/解锁输入；短按不会锁定它。\n\n点击视频以显示/隐藏控件。拖动时间线以寻找可用的位置。  停止全屏播放；短按“开始”键即可继续收听。\n\n视频选项：上/下选择一行；左/右准备音频/字幕选择， 应用它；  关闭面板。搜索将字幕选择保留在支持的文件上。\n\n音乐选项：上/下选择；  或左/右更改随机播放、重复播放或颜色。  > 播放器更改图稿布局而不重新启动音频。布局遵循主题或您保存的选择。\n\n图像\n\n 放大。 缩小。  旋转90度。开始重置缩放、位置和旋转。方向键/左摇杆平移；松开即可停止运动。\n\n用一根手指拖动进行平移；捏两下即可缩放。点击可显示/隐藏控件。  打开Sections， 图像信息。  关闭打开的面板或返回文件。\n\n旋转循环 0、90、180 和 270 度。右摇杆和两指扭转不是旋转控制。")
